WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.153
Structured Text and ladder sketch
This experimental OpenPLC fork displays a ladder sketch beside the Structured Text editor. No PLC is
connected.

2
00:00:06.253 --> 00:00:13.225
Edit the program source
The sketch updates from supported assignments. It is a display-only aid; Structured Text remains the
program.

3
00:00:13.325 --> 00:00:20.349
Inspect a conditional assignment
The parser supports a limited subset of ST. The sketch is not a verified conversion to an executable
ladder program.

4
00:00:20.449 --> 00:00:26.216
Agent interface
The fork includes an ST-editing chat panel. This recording shows the interface without submitting
code to a model.
